  "description": "GAMDII crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H48 Nd4 O24 4+,4(C1 F3 O3 S1 1-),2(C4 H10 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.727-4.102 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.55-115.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(μ3-OH)4(μ2-C9H7O3)4(H2O)8](CF3SO3)4·2C4H10O·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
